B.OI=new A.iJ("assets/images/photo_01.jpg","THE BEGINNING","A small moment that became important","This is our first memory together, we easily found ourselves in each other's company. I knew I wanted to remember this day forever.",-0.035)
B.OJ=new A.iJ("assets/images/photo_02.jpg","A RANDOM DAY","One of my favorite smiles","Your smile is the most beautiful thing I have ever seen. It makes me feel like I am home.",0.028)
B.OD=new A.iJ("assets/images/photo_03.jpg","LITTLE THINGS","The kind of memory I keep replaying",'That morning, when I said "I miss you" and you replied "I miss you too", I felt like the world stopped for a moment. It was a small thing, but it meant everything to me.',-0.02)
B.OG=new A.iJ("assets/images/photo_04.jpg","ANOTHER CHAPTER","Somehow, you made this day warmer","It's like we didn't care about the rain, the cold, or the wind. We just wanted to be together and enjoy the moment.",0.045)
