B.OE=new A.iJ("assets/images/photo_06.jpg","TIRA MISS U","Proof that the best memories are rarely planned","It's not the bouquet, the dress, or the location that makes a memory special. It's you, your presence, and the way you make me feel that makes every moment unforgettable.",0.025)
B.OH=new A.iJ("assets/images/photo_07.jpg","MORE TO COME","I hope we make a lot more of these","If I could, I would freeze this moment in time and keep it forever. But I know that the best memories are the ones we create together, and I can't wait to make more with you.",-0.04)
